#. <CLT 4>超高校級の絶望…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The Ultimate Despair...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>１年前の人類史上最大最悪の絶望的事件を
#. 引き起こした連中…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A group of people who caused The Tragedy one year\n"
"ago...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボク達をコロシアイ学園生活に巻き込み、
#. それを放送するなんて計画を立てた連中…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Those same people put together this killing game and\n"
"began broadcasting it around the world.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>最悪に絶望的な連中…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The most desperately awful group of people ever...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それが黒幕の正体…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>*That* is the mastermind's true identity.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ようやくハッキリした、ボクらの本当の敵…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Our enemy has finally been revealed...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、まず今は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But right now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. とにかく、この酷い場所から出るのが先ね。
msgctxt "0008 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Right now we have to get out of this horrible place."
msgstr ""

#. 話はそれからよ…
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Figuring out the rest of the story can come after."
msgstr ""

#. うん…そうだね…
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, you're right..."
msgstr ""

#. …霧切さん、例の物ってまだ持ってる？
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Kyoko, do you still have that one thing?"
msgstr ""

#. 学園長室から盗み出した、
#. モノクマの秘密道具的な鍵…
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Monokuma's \"secret tool\" that you got from the\n"
"headmaster's room?"
msgstr ""

#. …もちろん、持ってるわ。
msgctxt "0013 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Of course I do."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕を追い詰める為の大事な鍵よ。
#. 手放したりするはずないでしょう。
msgctxt "0014 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It's an absolutely vital part of ensnaring the\n"
"mastermind. I would never part with it."
msgstr ""

#. それって、学園中のすべての鍵を
#. 解錠出来るんだよね？
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And it can open any door in the school, right?"
msgstr ""

#. えぇ、そうよ。
msgctxt "0016 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "Đúng vậy."

#. <CLT 4>だったら、あそこのドアにも使えるはずだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then we should be able to use it on that door, right?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかし、すごい量のゴミだ…
#. 我ながら、よくこんな場所にいられたよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's so much garbage here. I can't believe this\n"
"place is even still inhabitable...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかし、すごい量のゴミだ…
#. 我ながら、よくこんな場所にいられたよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's so much garbage here. I can't believe this\n"
"place is even still inhabitable...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって…机か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is...a desk.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>きっと、ボクと一緒に落ちてきたものだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's probably the one that fell down here with me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これ…飛行機か？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is that...an airplane?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何でこんな物が
#. 学園のゴミ捨て場に捨てられてるんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>How'd something like that wind up in the school's\n"
"garbage pit?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ロケットに…戦車…だよな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's...a rocket, and a tank...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>深く考えない方がいい状況だな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better not think too much about what I'm seeing\n"
"down here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ガチャ、ガチャ…」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Rattle rattle*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>“Lạch cạch lạch cạch!”\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>鍵が掛かってる…けど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's locked. But...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今だったら、方法があるはずだ。
#. このドアを開けられる方法が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We have a way to open this door.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、霧切さん…その鍵を使えば、
#. あのドアも開くはずだよね？
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Hey, Kyoko. We can use that key of yours to open this\n"
"door, right?"
msgstr ""

#. …やってみましょう。
msgctxt "0030 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Let's find out."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女の手にしたモノクマ模様の鍵が、
#. ゆっくりと鍵穴へ差し込まれる。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko took out the key with the Monokuma design on it\n"
"and slid it into the keyhole.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And then...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Và rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 23>「カチャ…」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Click*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. やった！　開いた！
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yes! It opened!"
msgstr ""

#. これで出られるはずよ。行きましょう…
msgctxt "0035 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "And now we can get out of here. Let's go."
msgstr ""

#. …うん。
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>閉ざされていたドアを開け、
#. ボクらは、ゴミ捨て場を後にした…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We quickly opened the door and made our escape from\n"
"the garbage pit.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今だったら、方法があるはずだ。
#. あのドアを開けられる方法が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We have a way to open this door.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ようやく…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Finally...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ようやくだった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We were finally free.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、ほっと一息…
#. なんてヒマはない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But there wasn't even time to take a breath of relief.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって…本当の戦いはこれからなんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Because the real fight had just begun...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
